repository-code: "https://github.com/RitAreaSciencePark/Protein_Crystallization_Data_Extraction"
url: "https://github.com/RitAreaSciencePark/Protein_Crystallization_Data_Extraction"

abstract: >
  An automated computational pipeline that accepts a protein sequence as input,
  retrieves all related PDB structures via the RCSB API, extracts and filters
  crystallization condition metadata, annotates entries with chemical compound
  information, and outputs analysis ready CSV, pdf, and high-resolution figures.
keywords:
  - protein crystallography
  - crystallization conditions
  - PDB
  - data mining
  - structural biology
  - automated pipeline

